		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-13" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:36pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:3;text-align:justify;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(2)<FONT STYLE="width: 30px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>In these Articles, unless there be something within the subject or context inconsistent with such construction:</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-14" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:72pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:3;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(a)<FONT STYLE="width: 30px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>words importing the singular include the plural and vice versa;</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-14" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:72pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:3;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(b)<FONT STYLE="width: 30px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>words importing a gender include both gender and the neuter;</FONT></P>
		<P CLASS="ParaOverride-14" STYLE="margin:0;padding:0;border-width:0;margin-left:72pt;margin-top:8pt;orphans:3;text-align:justify;text-indent:-36pt;widows:3;margin-top:8pt;"><FONT CLASS="CharOverride-2" STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman PS Std, serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">(c)<FONT STYLE="width: 30px;display: inline-block;">&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;&#x00a0;</FONT>words importing persons include companies, associations and bodies of persons whether corporate or not;</FONT></P>
